  "why": "The 2026-08-15 Etna collection screened procedure purity on the image filename's procedure slug alone. That is insufficient: a combined case whose photographs all publish as `breast-augmentation-<case>-...` is still a combined case. Re-screening the 801 delivered pairs on each case's OWN published text found 22 cases across 7 clinics whose text states a second procedure was performed - augmentation with mastopexy, mommy makeover with tummy tuck, augmentation with liposuction, nipple reduction, and one implant revision with pocket tightening. roth case 42 publishes it as a chart field reading 'Breast Lift with Augmentation'. Each retired pair's evidence sentence is recorded per case in the JSON named above. The captain ruled on 2026-08-19 to retire all 60, consistent with the 2026-08-14 and 2026-08-15 rulings: any case whose after photograph shows a second procedure result is excluded, abdominal or breast. Five further pairs (tccs-682-front, northraleigh-20-front, northraleigh-22-front, hasen-40-front, ablavsky-43-front) name another procedure as an interest or a recommendation while describing only implants as performed; they are NOT covered by this ruling, are left in place, and are listed for a human look. colville-234-front was flagged by the screen and cleared on reading: 'a natural yet noticeable lift to her breasts' describes the implants' effect, not a mastopexy.",
